  "prefLabel": "Dec 103.04 Contact Information for the Committee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Dec 103.04 Contact Information for the Committee.\n\n(a) The committee operates out of the offices of the public utilities commission at the following address:\n\nN.H. Public Utilities Commission\n\n21 South Fruit Street, Suite 10\n\nConcord, NH 03301\n\n(b) Telephone inquiries may be made to the executive director of the public utilities commission at (603) 271-2431 or TDD Access-Relay NH: 1-800-735-296.\n\n(c) The committee’s website can be accessed through a link on the public utilities commission website at www.puc.nh.gov.\n\nSource. #9143, eff 4-25-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/dec100-200.html"
